<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italian 10-YR BTP sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italian 10-YR BTP sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a ninth tranche of 2.5 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) carrying a 6.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   February 1, 2007   previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.93 pct vs	6.78 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     7.86 pct vs	7.69 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price   93.40   vs     94.40</p>
<p> Bids		 3.510 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   2.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with a previous auction of a seventh tranche of the 10-year Btp on March 13.</p>
</text>
